&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, every day brings the extraordinary! Whether it’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Daniel Ricciardo’s Formula 1 Car&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/579-fossils&quot;&gt;Woolly Mammoth’s Skeleton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/l/10035805&quot;&gt;Lady Gaga&#39;s Jumpsuit&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Usain Bolt’s running shoe&lt;/a&gt;, we encounter exceptional objects every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a one-of-a-kind marketplace for buying and selling special objects. Each week, more than 100,000 unique items are auctioned, all carefully curated by our passionate in-house experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having sold over 25 million unique objects, our mission is to become the world’s most popular destination for special objects. As a growing, diverse and sustainable scale-up, we proudly live by three core values. If these values resonate with you, we’d love to explore how you can join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership and driving impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Catawiki as a &lt;em&gt;UX Designer&lt;/em&gt; shaping the experience of buying and selling special objects, from discovery through to the experience after a sale. This role is not tied to a single product vertical: its scope can sit within Demand (buyer-side features), Supply (seller-side features) or Fulfilment (post-sale experiences, including payments, shipping and customer service).&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll bring a connected view of the marketplace to your product area, understanding how buyer, seller and post-sale experiences influence one another. You&#39;ll identify where people need support and where design can make the greatest difference, balancing customer needs, business goals and technical constraints. You&#39;ll lead through your work and influence, rather than people management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead design for parts of the seller and expert experience, from research and early concepts through prototyping, delivery and learning after launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use customer research, behavioural data and business insight to frame problems, identify needs and prioritise design opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn complex problems into clear journeys, interaction and interface designs, prototypes and service flows. Test ideas with customers and colleagues, and use what you learn to improve them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Managers, Engineers, Data Scientists, UX Writers, supply stakeholders and other designers to shape and deliver solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance user empathy with business goals and technical constraints, connecting your design decisions to measurable customer and commercial impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to design systems and shared patterns that create coherent experiences across Catawiki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Figma and practical AI-assisted workflows to explore ideas and build prototypes, applying judgment to the outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate your thinking clearly, tell the story behind your decisions and iterate in response to feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate ambiguity and competing priorities, getting up to speed quickly with the aim of contributing productively within your first month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of experience owning UX or product design work end to end&lt;/strong&gt;, with a portfolio showing how you approached complex problems, the decisions you made and the outcomes you contributed to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong interaction design, prototyping and visual communication skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with an understanding of how to use and improve design systems and shared patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience conducting or contributing to customer research and translating research&lt;/strong&gt;, data and direct feedback into design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Figma skills and practical experience using AI for design ideation or prototyping&lt;/strong&gt;, alongside a willingness to keep experimenting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear, structured communication in English&lt;/strong&gt; and the ability to explain your approach to design and non-design partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured problem solving, independent decision-making and systems thinking&lt;/strong&gt;: understanding how decisions within one product area affect connected journeys and the wider marketplace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The ability to manage stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;, collaborate across disciplines and influence decisions without formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability and openness to feedback as priorities&lt;/strong&gt;, processes and design tools evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Helpful experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working in a smaller product company, e-commerce platform or marketplace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing seller journeys or working on marketplace experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering in less structured environments with several competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Across disciplines&lt;/span&gt;: You&#39;ll work closely with Product Managers, Engineers, Data Scientists, UX Writers, supply stakeholders and other designers, bringing customer needs, business goals and technical constraints into shared decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;From evidence to iteration&lt;/span&gt;: Customer research, behavioural data and direct feedback help shape the work. You&#39;ll explore and test ideas, iterate with customers and colleagues, and keep learning after launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;With ownership and openness&lt;/span&gt;: You&#39;ll own design decisions, explain your rationale and bring feedback into the process. Clear communication and influence matter more than formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;With shared patterns and practical tools&lt;/span&gt;: We use Figma, design systems and shared patterns to build coherent experiences. AI-assisted workflows and rapid prototyping help us explore ideas and test assumptions, with design judgment guiding how we use the results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where You’ll Be&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;em&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;textItalic&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt; role based in Lisbon. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;You will work from our &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Lisbon Hub&lt;/span&gt; a minimum of 2 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At this time, we are only considering candidates who are already based in the &lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Portugal&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;. As a result, visa sponsorship and relocation support are not available for this position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In Return&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be part of an enthusiastic, highly motivated team of &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;800+ Catawikians&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A competitive &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Annual Gross Base Salary&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;depending on your level, competencies, and overall experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Meal Allowance Card&lt;/span&gt; stipend per working day, in addition to salary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Health Insurance&lt;/span&gt; from day 1 (including dental coverage), with access to multiple hospitals and clinics and a vast wellness network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work From Home Allowance&lt;/span&gt; to help with your monthly household bills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Commuting&lt;/span&gt; between your home and our office is covered by Catawiki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazing&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Office&lt;/span&gt; right in the centre of Lisbon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working with Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a visible impact &lt;/strong&gt;by working at scale in a global organisation serving millions of customers across 80+ categories. In our flat structure, every role has a broad scope and directly impacts both our customers and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow&lt;/strong&gt; through our Learning &amp;amp; Development initiatives, including clear development plans and mentorship programmes to support your career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of connection defines us&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re a passionate, diverse team of 800+ Catawikians representing 60+ nationalities. We foster an inclusive and queer-friendly environment where everyone is encouraged to bring their full self to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celebrate life’s moments with us. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll receive a €100 Catavoucher when you join, a €50 Catavoucher on your birthday, and an extra day off each year to “Pursue Your Passion&lt;strong&gt;”&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer additional leave for key work anniversaries and important life events. Benefits may vary by location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offices and Way of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our vibrant offices in Amsterdam and Lisbon are designed to inspire collaboration. Most Catawikians operate in a hybrid setup, combining office-based and remote work, with a minimum of two days per week in the office, unless a role is explicitly stated as fully remote or fully office-based.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply with an English CV and Cover Letter. By applying, you agree to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/conditions/applicant-privacy-policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Catawiki’s Applicant Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support the review of your application. AI may help us assess how your experience matches the requirements of the role, but hiring decisions are always made by our recruitment team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Sword, we’re building AI to heal billions and unlock humanity’s full potential. In doing so, we’re pioneering AI Care, a fundamentally new approach to healthcare built for medical reasoning, safety, and real-time treatment, not generic technology applied after the fact. As both a clinical-centric frontier AI lab and an applied AI platform, Sword is reimagining how care is delivered at scale, removing traditional barriers like appointments, waiting rooms, and stigma so more people can access the care they need—and ultimately get back to lives lived in full.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since 2020, Sword has expanded across physical therapy, women’s health, cardiometabolic, and mental health, and is now moving beyond the session to a fully AI-native, 24/7 care program that brings physical activity, therapeutic exercise, psychotherapy, nutrition, and behavior change into one connected experience. More than 700,000 members across three continents have completed over 10 million AI sessions, helping 1,000+ enterprise clients avoid more than $1 billion in unnecessary healthcare costs. Backed by 42 clinical studies, 44+ patents, and more than $500 million raised from leading investors including Khosla Ventures, General Catalyst, and Founders Fund, Sword is defining a new standard for healthcare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;AI&amp;nbsp;Proficiency at Sword&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI fluency is a core expectation at Sword. Every candidate is assessed against our three-level framework — be ready to share real examples of how AI is already part of how you work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explorer (Level 1) — Uses AI daily to boost personal productivity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Builder (Level 2) — Creates workflows and tools that elevate the whole team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Integrator (Level 3) — Embeds AI into products and processes at scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every hire must demonstrate at least Level 1. The expected level will vary depending on the seniority of the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Product Designer to take end-to-end ownership of Sword’s web enrollment experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be responsible for optimizing the enrollment journey, creating seamless and accessible user experiences, and driving measurable improvements in conversion. Working closely with Product, Engineering, Growth, and teams across Sword, you’ll turn business goals, data insights and user feedback into impactful design solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on role for a designer who combines strong product thinking, craft and execution, thrives in a fast-paced environment, and is passionate about continuously improving digital experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the design enrollment experience end-to-end:&lt;/strong&gt; Take full responsibility for the design and continuous optimization of Sword’s web enrollment journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experiment and iterate: &lt;/strong&gt;Embrace a test-and-learn mindset, continuously identifying opportunities to improve an experience that is never truly finished.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive conversion and usability:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead iterative design cycles focused on improving conversion, reducing friction, and enhancing usability and accessibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make data-informed decisions:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate quantitative data, user research, and customer feedback into meaningful design improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage AI thoughtfully:&lt;/strong&gt; Explore and use AI tools where they can meaningfully accelerate your workflow and improve the quality of your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally&lt;/strong&gt;: Work closely with your Product Manager and Tech Lead, as well as teams and GMs across Sword, to define problems and deliver the best solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate throughout implementation, ensuring smooth handoffs, feasibility, and high-quality execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain design consistency: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with other designers to ensure a cohesive experience across the entire acquisition funnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to the design system:&lt;/strong&gt; Support and evolve organism-level components, balancing immediate delivery needs with scalable and reusable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay curious:&lt;/strong&gt; Continuously investigate what&#39;s working, what&#39;s not, and why, using insights to inform your next design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience as a Product Designer, ideally working on complex web experiences, enrollment flows, onboarding journeys or conversion-focused products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in UX/UI design, with a solid understanding of interaction design, usability, accessibility, and responsive web experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong visual taste and aptitude to translate those into clear visuals, keeping all graphics on-brand and consistent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning product design initiatives end-to-end, from problem discovery and exploration through delivery and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data-informed approach to design, with the ability to interpret product metrics, identify opportunities, and use insights to drive improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing for conversion, ideally with exposure to experimentation, A/B testing, and growth optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent proficiency in Figma, including working with components, variants, and design systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating closely with Product Managers and Engineers in agile, cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to rationalize design decisions, articulate design concepts clearly, and communicate the reasoning behind your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently, manage multiple priorities, and thrive in a fast-paced environment with diverse design challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive mindset, strong attention to detail, and a genuine curiosity for learning and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and highly organized.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently, drive multiple projects at a time, and integrate quickly within a fast-paced environment with a variety of design challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver work on time and proactively communicate when extensions are needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working remotely with a global team across multiple timezones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;*The range below reflects base, variable, and equity for this role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;This is a starting point, not a ceiling — once someone joins and proves they&#39;re outlier talent, we adjust quickly to make sure their compensation matches their impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Job titles may span more than one career level, so actual pay depends on skills, qualifications, experience, location, and market demand, among other factors. The range reflects base salary plus any variable, bonus, or sales incentives, and our estimate of the value of private company stock options where applicable. It&#39;s subject to change, and future stock value isn&#39;t guaranteed. Sword also offers additional benefits beyond total compensation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Total Compensation Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€40.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€60.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;sup&gt;Country-specific benefits may vary and will be detailed separately.&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;sup&gt;Sword Health complies with applicable Federal and State civil rights laws and does not discriminate on the basis of Age, Ancestry, Color, Citizenship, Gender, Gender expression, Gender identity, Gender information, Marital status, Medical condition, National origin, Physical or mental disability, Pregnancy, Race, Religion, Caste, Sexual orientation, and Veteran status.&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BOUT TIDE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we help SMEs save time and money in the running of their businesses by not only offering business accounts and related banking services, but also a comprehensive set of highly usable and connected administrative solutions, from invoicing to accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tide is transforming the small business banking market and now supports over 2 million members globally across the UK, India, Germany and France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Using advanced technology, all solutions are designed with SMEs in mind. With quick onboarding, low fees and innovative features, we thrive on making data driven decisions to serve our mission: to help SMEs save time and money so they can get back to doing what they love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tide facts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tide is available for UK, Indian, German and French SMEs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 2 million members globally and rapidly growing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over $300 million raised in funding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3,000 Tideans globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognised with Great Place to Work certification three years in a row, and among India’s Top 50 Best Workplaces in Banking, Financial Services, and Insurance in 2026&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have offices in Central London, with a member support and technology centre in Sofia, Bulgaria, technology centres in Serbia, Romania, Lithuania and Hyderabad and offices in Gurugram, New Delhi, Berlin, Paris and Luxembourg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a design leader to help shape the experience for key areas of the member experience as the Tide app continues to evolve across 55+ products.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Design Manager, you will act as a true player/coach across 1-2 key product domains (groups of products). You will lead and mentor a team of 4 to 8 Product Designers integrated into individual products across the domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an empowering people manager, who is passionate about the craft. You are ready to jump into the details and lead hands-on design for critical strategic initiatives, while balancing supporting your team &amp;amp; resourcing. You will also work closely with both your domain leaders and design managers in other domains, to help build cohesive experiences across Tide.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Flexible hybrid model with an expectation of visiting our London office 2–4 times a month.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and Build the Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Coach, develop, and set actionable career goals for a team of 4 to 8 Product Designers. You will also actively manage resourcing, balance team workloads, and drive hiring to scale the design function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as a Player/Coach:&lt;/strong&gt; Jump into the details and lead hands-on design work for specific, critical strategic initiatives, diving into Figma to deliver validated, high-impact member experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the Domain Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with domain leads (PMs and Engineering) to define OKRs, prioritize roadmaps, and craft the overarching strategy and experience for your specific domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure a Connected App Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate closely with design managers in other domains to align patterns, share insights, and guarantee a seamless, connected journey across the entire app.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE ARE LOOKING FOR:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Design Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Track record of managing or leading product designers in a fast-paced SaaS, fintech, or scale-up environment. You have demonstrable experience of hiring and developing designers, managing resourcing across your team, and balancing team support with strategic project delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Player/Coach Mentality:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong portfolio showing both strategic product thinking and top-tier UI/UX execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile &amp;amp; Autonomous:&lt;/strong&gt; Highly comfortable navigating ambiguity and collaborating with cross-functional peers in an agile setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership &amp;amp; influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience balancing user and business needs, working closely with senior stakeholders. You know how to manage trade-offs between in-depth work and quick wins or experiments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Design Workflow &amp;amp; AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep experience working across the full, evolving design lifecycle—from research, concepts, prototyping, testing, and handover. You are also excited to pioneer the inclusion of AI in our processes, leveraging it from early design flows right through to pushing code changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Small business knowledge (desirable):&lt;/strong&gt; You understand personally the challenge we’re trying to solve, in having experience of designing for small businesses or even better, having worked around small businesses yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL GET IN RETURN:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our location-specific employee benefits are designed to cater to the unique needs of Tideans:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Compensation –&amp;nbsp; Competitive salary and share options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time Off – Generous annual leave on top of bank holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental Leave – Paid maternity, paternity, and adoption leave to support your family journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sabbatical – Extended unpaid and paid leave options after completing milestone years with Tide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to salary sacrifice benefits – like Nursery (could save up to 47% on fees!) and Cycle to Work discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Insurance – Comprehensive Private family insurance plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life &amp;amp; Accident Cover – Comprehensive accidental and life insurance protection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Wellbeing – Access to therapy sessions, courses, meditations, and workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement Planning – Build your retirement fund faster with Tide’s pension scheme on eligible earnings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteering &amp;amp; Development Days – Paid days annually for volunteering or personal growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development – Annual budget for books, courses, coaching, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;WOO (Work Outside the Office) – Work from abroad for up to 90 days annually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Setup – Contribution towards setting up your home office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Laptop Ownership – Keep your old laptop and get a new one when it’s time for a replacement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Snacks &amp;amp; Meals – Daily breakfast spread with all-day coffee, tea, and juices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-NZ1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;TIDE IS A PLACE FOR EVERYONE&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we believe that we can only succeed if we let our differences enrich our culture. Our Tideans come from a variety of backgrounds and experience levels. We consider everyone irrespective of their ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, veteran, neurodiversity or differently-abled status. We celebrate diversity in our workforce as a cornerstone of our success. Our commitment to a broad spectrum of ideas and backgrounds is what enables us to build products that resonate with our members’ diverse needs and lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are One Team and foster a transparent and inclusive environment, where everyone’s voice is heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Tide, we thrive on diversity, embracing various backgrounds and experiences. We welcome all individuals regardless of ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, or disability. Our inclusive culture is key to our success, helping us build products that meet our members&#39; diverse needs. We are One Team, committed to transparency and ensuring everyone’s voice is heard.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;It has come to our attention that individuals or agencies are falsely claiming to represent Tide and are reaching out to candidates regarding job opportunities. Please be aware that:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tide does&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;charge any fees at any stage of the recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;All official Tide job opportunities are listed exclusively on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tide.co/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Careers Page&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and applications should be submitted through this channel.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Communication from Tide will only come from an official&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;@tide&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;.co&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tide does not work with agencies or recruiters without prior formal engagement, and we do not authorize third parties to make job offers on our behalf.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you are contacted by anyone misrepresenting Tide or requesting payment, please treat it as fraudulent and report it to us immediately at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:talent@tide.co&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;talent@tide.co&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your safety and trust are important to us, and we are committed to ensuring a fair and transparent recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Tide leverages AI to enhance our hiring experience. You can read more about how we use AI in our recruitment process in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/5MFtWSdG8YLKq3jZkK52NY/3f18633073e6cdbd03bba4b9791c64f4/Using_AI_throughout_the_Hiring_Process.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AI Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be processed by Tide for recruitment purposes and in accordance with &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/30JAUcDJMlaCwUKt4zoW0j/dd541981a67b6838d6e54537704bc8aa/Tide_Recruitment_Privacy_Notice_Job_Post_Version.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/1MYf6q4ZMWugpeaROVETBN/526e9c160a2de03576413c81657c6466/Recruitment_Privacy_Notice__Final_Draft__Sep_2024_.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Tide&#39;s Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mentimeter is an engagement company with a simple goal: to make every leader better. Through interaction, insights and recommendations, its platform helps organizations turn participation into better understanding and stronger performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in Stockholm in 2012, Mentimeter is used by 20 million people each month across 1.3 million organizations. At Mentimeter, we believe better leadership starts with listening and that the strongest results are achieved together. That’s why we foster a culture built on curiosity, collaboration and shared ownership. By joining us, you’ll help leaders turn participation into deeper understanding and stronger performance, advancing our ambition to help more than one billion people listen, learn and work better together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Designer at Mentimeter, you own the experience your team ships and how it fits into the whole: making sure it works, solves a problem people actually have, and holds together as we build more. Millions of leaders use Mentimeter to lead: to make a decision, bring people with them, understand what their organisation actually thinks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You join at the point where the work gets hardest and most interesting. Mentimeter has grown from one tool into an engagement suite, and making those pieces feel like one experience leaders and organisations can build on is now one of our hardest problems. The payoff is turning a great moment of engagement into results people act on, insight that holds over time, and value that spreads across an organisation, powered by AI that helps leaders see what matters and act on it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll report to the Design Director for that area and work day to day inside a product team, alongside a Product Manager and Product Engineers. Beyond the team, you’ll work with other competences such as User Research, Analytics, Content Design, Accessibility, Design Systems, Marketing and Sales to understand users and keep the suite coherent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design end-to-end experiences across the full development model, from problem framing through shipped and refined iteration: interaction, visual design, usability, prototyping and testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take an ambiguous problem and leave the room with a clear problem statement, hypotheses and success criteria you can evaluate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ground direction in user evidence. Spend real time with users, read the signal, and read the release data afterwards to know whether anything actually changed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Name the trade-offs between user value, usability, coherence and technical constraint instead of letting them sit implicit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design patterns that scale across surfaces and teams, and protect product-wide coherence as the suite grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You own the experience, not the handoff. You work from the problem through to what shipped and what it changed, and you treat &quot;did this work for the user?&quot; as part of your job, not someone else&#39;s follow-up. You can hold a strong design opinion without needing to win the room, and you’d rather get to the right solution to the right problem than polish the wrong one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You work through AI as part of how you design, not a tool you reach for occasionally. You use it across research, exploration and execution, you read its output critically rather than ship it, and you hold a real view of where it strengthens the work and where it degrades the experience. Autocomplete is not what we mean.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You treat insight and data as design material, not reporting. You&#39;re comfortable close to users and close to the numbers, and you bring the team closer to both.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;This role might not be for you if…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You use AI only as autocomplete, or steer clear of it, rather than making it part of how you design and solve problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want the problem handed to you fully framed, with the user need and success criteria already decided.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You see design as what happens after the real decisions are made.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You treat research and data as someone else&#39;s job.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You consider the work done when the design ships, rather than when you know whether it changed something for users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to stay in visual polish and avoid the ambiguity of early product work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio that shows end-to-end product design: problem framing, interaction and visual craft, and shipped outcomes, not only final screens.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence that you ground design in user research and data, and change direction based on what you learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI built into how you already work, across research, exploration and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product thinking: you frame design decisions in terms of user value, business impact and risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems awareness: you design patterns that hold across surfaces and teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, and comfort working independently and in a cross-functional team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t have to know Swedish. Daily work is carried out in English and the Mentimeter team currently boasts over 50 nationalities!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is primarily an on-site role at Mentimeter HQ in Stockholm.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Compensation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Mentimeter, we believe in fair and transparent compensation that grows with you. The salary range for this role is SEK 65,000–SEK 82,000 per month. It’s intentionally broad to reflect the different stages of growth within the role: from early development to deep expertise and meaningful impact.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Where an individual is placed within the range depends on factors such as relevant experience, demonstrated skills, and alignment with the role’s requirements. We’re committed to supporting your growth. You’ll have ongoing development conversations with your manager, and your salary will evolve as you build skills and contribute to our mission.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;In addition to your monthly salary, we offer a comprehensive benefits package—learn more about it here: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;https://www.mentimeter.com/benefits/stockholm&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Mentimeter can offer&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Mentimeter we can offer a diverse and inclusive work environment supported by smart and driven colleagues. We believe in continuous professional development for all of our colleagues and therefore offer access to a leadership program (including external personal coach) and relevant education to ensure that we continue to be state-of-the-art when it comes to innovating and building Mentimeter. Your place will be in a growing company with lots of career opportunities, working on a beloved product used by more than 300 million people. It’s not all about work though, we also offer a very healthy view on work-life balance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All of this comes attached with a competitive compensation and benefits package, including pension contributions. Learn more about our benefits by visiting our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mentimeter.com/benefits&quot;&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;AI and Hiring at Mentimeter&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Mentimeter, we believe AI helps us work smarter - but it never replaces the human assessment, curiosity, and personal connection that define our culture and our hiring. We use AI as a sparring partner: to bounce ideas, bring new perspectives, support structure, and make our work more efficient. But the meaning, decisions, and interactions always come from people.&amp;nbsp;AI strengthens our work, but it does not define it. At Mentimeter, we’re not building an AI-driven hiring process - we’re building a people-first culture, where technology helps us listen, learn, and grow together.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture at Mentimeter&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Mentimeter we believe in giving everyone a voice - regardless of who you are. So we build a platform that does just that. Our platform is not only our product but also our organization. A platform where people feel safe, where differences are embraced, a place where you can have fun. We strongly encourage applicants who are people of color, LGBTQ+, women, people with disabilities, and/or formerly incarcerated people, and a college degree is not strictly required. In order to give everyone a voice, we need to be as diverse as our users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more about our culture by visiting our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mentimeter.com/culture&quot;&gt;Culture page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;Review our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mentimeter.com/trust/legal/candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for more information.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
